### 2. Change nothing else

- Keep the `//truebdd:concept when "halving"` record, the function name and the `func(*State, []string) error` signature exactly as the engine wrote them.
- Do not touch `tests/calc/steps/register.go` — the registration `suite.Step("^the Owner halves (-\\d+)$", concept9d6e5581dfa811cf4e3a8cc944e187fb33e1289b93c5e58b45730bc9c8c3d3bb)` and the pattern are the engine's.
- Do not modify `tests/calc/steps/definitions.go` (`halveNumber`, `result`), `tests/calc/steps/state.go`, `tests/calc/calc_test.go`, `tests/calc/scenarios/scenarios.go`, the Specification or any service code.
